{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106100","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1410610001:0":{"text":"インドラ、よくもこの私に矢を……！サロクディアを裏切るつもりですか！？","source_cn":"……因度厄，你居然敢对我射出箭矢！你想反叛吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AB4E7F0A7CC12B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410610002:0":{"text":"謀反でも、共犯でも、好きにすればいい。","source_cn":"请便，以反叛定罪也好，以帮凶定罪也好，我不在乎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADC913ED4B769C51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410610003:0":{"text":"愚かな……この裏切り者を捕らえなさい！","source_cn":"愚蠢……快来人制伏这个叛徒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BB2BFD16166279C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410610004:0":{"text":"私に近づいてみろ。そいつの頭を、この矢で地面に縫い付けてやる。","source_cn":"谁敢拦我？尽管试试。我会用箭将他的脑袋钉在地上，让他与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8C47D1768589147","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410610005:0":{"text":"インドラ、一体どうしたというのです？あなたは、汚らわしい異邦者に誑かされているのですよ！","source_cn":"因度厄……你到底想做什么？你不要被这些肮脏的外来者蒙蔽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F401E91CBA06750","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410610006:0":{"text":"私が知りたいことはただひとつ。フェリルが知った秘密は何なのか……","source_cn":"我现在只想知道，斐利尔究竟知晓了怎样的秘密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14429AF0B0A1101F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410610007:0":{"text":"それは、彼の命を奪うほどのものだったのか……？","source_cn":"那个秘密……竟然害他被你夺去生命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CA4A16599A118A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410610008:0":{"text":"私はこの国を――","source_cn":"我是在保护——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x595840967BBBFEBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410610009:0":{"text":"黙れ。","source_cn":"闭嘴。<key:dialog41>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87A29969ECFE7C99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410610010:0":{"text":"言い訳は聞きたくない。答えは、私の手で見つけ出す。","source_cn":"我不想听你解释，我只相信自己找到的答案。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80F560857D54DDC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410610011:0":{"text":"……行くぞ、マーリン。","source_cn":"……梅林，我们走。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1444